Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:13:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/26] [Diffusion] Tests for the causal KV archive seam

Session-handle validation, disabled capture scope, ReelCache args, import
isolation (the disabled path imports nothing from ReelCache; an enabled backend
without ReelCache fails explicitly) and bitwise equality of the next chunk's
attention view between a native cache and a reset cache restored through
replay_layout/install_restored_history (LongLive2-like global sink with pinned
scene cuts, sink only, pinned without global sink, window shorter than the
buffer, full history), at every pause point.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
